cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the repository."
title: "Cross-Region Forest Biomass Transfer with GEDI and AlphaEarth"
abstract: >-
  This repository documents a study of whether annual AlphaEarth embeddings
  transfer GEDI L4A aboveground-biomass relationships from Georgia and South
  Carolina, USA, to Kaihua County, Zhejiang, China, more effectively and with
  fewer local labels than conventional Sentinel-1/Sentinel-2 features.
  The frozen experiments, frozen result tables, and reproducibility manifests
  are provided. No formal publication is associated with this project yet.
authors:
